<main class="content-card"><h2>About E-Book Shop</h2><p>E-Book Shop is a college project demo for browsing engineering books and magazines. Students can create an account, explore the catalog, and collect books in a shopping cart. An administrator can add books and cover images.</p><p>Sample catalog items are included so the project is ready to present after the MySQL setup.</p></main></body></html>
